    "detailed_description": "<h1>\u3010E-mail\u3011</h1><p><a href=\"mailto:casualfishgames@foxmail.com\">casualfishgames@foxmail.com</a></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332040/extras/3e57937f7de513895b9d4758386ddf8e.avif?t=1743991464\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Mushroom Island, a place to relax and unwind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332040/extras/4e2cd7e2e1279d0b8ea18451e6f60491.poster.avif?t=1743991464\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332040/extras/4e2cd7e2e1279d0b8ea18451e6f60491.webm?t=1743991464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332040/extras/4e2cd7e2e1279d0b8ea18451e6f60491.mp4?t=1743991464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332040/extras/c9e59035bb95e32deb60a9fa9e657e57.poster.avif?t=1743991464\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332040/extras/c9e59035bb95e32deb60a9fa9e657e57.webm?t=1743991464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332040/extras/c9e59035bb95e32deb60a9fa9e657e57.mp4?t=1743991464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332040/extras/7dcbd7d5e892540ac49f176ba3